What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/14a50000.audio-controller/pmu_state
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Mollomm1 <Mollomm1@users.noreply.github.com>
Description:
		Explicit, read-only snapshot of the Exynos7885 DISPAUD PMU
		configuration/status and ABOX CA7 configuration/status/option.
		The five values are printed as eight-digit hexadecimal words.
		Reading this attribute does not start ABOX or write registers.

